<title>HONG KONG: Indosuez WI Carr sets warrants on Swire.</title>
<headline>Indosuez WI Carr sets warrants on Swire.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indosuez W.I. Carr (Derivatives) Ltd said on Wednesday it planned to issue 35 million American-style call warrants on shares of Swire Pacific Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$62.325	PREMIUM	 11 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$1.454	 GEARING	 4.76x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  04.JUN.98	EXER LOT	5,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$69.25</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
</text>
